-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border tabular-nums select-none transition-colors duration-[var(--duration-fast)] h-6 gap-1.5 px-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full font-medium border-red-200 bg-red-50 text-red-700 dark:border-red-800 dark:bg-red-950 dark:text-red-300 text-[10px]"><span class="relative z-10 inline-flex overflow-hidden"><span data-badge-label="true" variants="[object Object]" initial="initial" animate="animate" exit="exit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">critical</span></span></span><span class="font-semibold text-sm">Fila sem corretor</span></div><p class="text-xs text-foreground">A fila PME está sem corretor disponível há 25 minutos.</p><p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-medium">Ação recomendada: Escalar um corretor de plantão.</p></div><button data-slot="button" type="button" class="ct-press group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,scale] duration-[var(--duration-quick)] ease-[var(--ease-smooth-out)] outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/40 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-2 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 motion-reduce:transition-none [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 cursor-pointer border-border bg-card hover:bg-muted hover:border-border-strong text-foreground shadow-none gap-1.5 px-3 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-3.5 text-xs h-8">Resolver</button></div><div class="p-4 rounded-lg border flex items-start justify-between bg-card opacity-70"><div class="space-y-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span transition="[object Object]" class="relative inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border tabular-nums select-none transition-colors duration-[var(--duration-fast)] h-6 gap-1.5 px-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full font-medium border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 dark:border-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-950 dark:text-amber-300 text-[10px]"><span class="relative z-10 inline-flex overflow-hidden"><span data-badge-label="true" variants="[object Object]" initial="initial" animate="animate" exit="exit" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">warning</span></span></span><span class="font-semibold text-sm">Token perto de vencer</span></div><p class="text-xs text-foreground">O token da Meta vence em 7 dias.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-slot="card" data-variant="default" data-size="default" class="group/card flex min-w-0 flex-col text-card-foreground gap-[var(--size-spacing-04)] rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border bg-card p-[var(--size-spacing-05)] shadow-none border-border/70"><div><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square size-4 text-primary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>Simulador de Qualificação (Ambiente Dev Web)</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mt-1">Testar o comportamento da IA com simulação do motor de memória em tempo real.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="md:col-span-2 rounded-lg border p-4 bg-muted/20 flex flex-col h-[400px]"><div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-3 p-2"><div class="flex justify-start"><div class="max-w-[80%] rounded-lg p-3 text-xs bg-card border text-card-foreground">Olá! Tudo bem? Sou a Ana da Âncora da Âncora Corretora. Que ótimo falar com você! Para te passar as melhores opções de planos, como posso te chamar?</div></div></div><form class="flex gap-2 pt-2 border-t"><input id="base-ui-_r_d_" data-slot="input" placeholder="Digite a resposta do cliente..." class="h-8 w-full min-w-0 rounded-full border border-input bg-card px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-foreground shadow-none transition-[background-color,border-color,box-shadow] duration-[var(--duration-quick)] ease-[var(--ease-smooth-out)] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-6 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-xs file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground hover:border-border-strong focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/20 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:bg-muted/50 disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-1 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 motion-reduce:transition-none dark:bg-card dark:border-border" value=""><button data-slot="button" type="submit" class="ct-press group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-[background-color,border-color,color,box-shadow,scale] duration-[var(--duration-quick)] ease-[var(--ease-smooth-out)] outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/40 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-2 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 motion-reduce:transition-none [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 cursor-pointer bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-none hover:bg-primary/90 h-7.5 gap-1.5 px-3 text-xs has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg></button></form></div><div class="rounded-lg border p-4 bg-card space-y-3"><h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Inspetor de Memória Extraída</h4><div class="space-y-2 text-xs"><div>Nome: <span class="font-semibold">—</span></div><div>Plano: <span class="font-semibold">—</span></div><div>Vidas: <span class="font-semibold">—</span></div><div>Idade: <span class="font-semibold">—</span></div><div>Cidade: <span class="font-semibold">—</span></div><div>Email: <span class="font-semibold">—</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main></div>"`;

